# Build context: send only what the Dockerfiles copy.
# Build outputs from the host: the image restores and builds its own.
**/bin/
**/obj/
# Version control, tooling and documents that never go into an image.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
tests/
deploy/
preuves/
**/*.md
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
# Secrets and local settings.
.env
.env.*
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/secrets.json
**/*.user
